  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Port Moresby International Programme FY2024-25 ODA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide small grant funding to local NGOs and Community Based Organisations working in the field of gender equality and biodiversity and environmental protection, clean energy and education.  Projects will be focussed in the areas of Milne Bay, New Ireland and the Motu-Koita villages of Central Province.</narrative>
  </description>
